; brain:knowledge_base:406 says the shop can MEET a client at Phuket airport. Meeting a client is
; not delivering a bike to a destination, and the flow node is the one that speaks about delivery
; destinations, so the delivery rule below follows the flow node. The other line is declared so a
; later reader can see it was read and weighed, not missed.
