;
; COLLECTION IS FREE, AND THE FREE THING IS TIED TO A PAID DELIVERY. brain:booking_flow:89 records
; the standing phrase that collection FROM the client is free, paid delivery being the leg TO the
; client. brain:business_rules:635-638 states the boundary in its own heading -- THERE IS NO FREE
; RADIUS -- and reports the verbatim manager reply that delivery always goes separately. So the 0 in
; the seed's collection field is not a local courtesy in one area: it is the shop's rule, and the
; brain confirms it independently. Pickup is from Kamala, the base (brain:booking_flow:90).
; Kamala's own row is the one place where the two can be confused, and the brain writes both:
; delivery to Kamala is the 290 step, while a client who comes to the base collects for nothing.
; A free SELF-PICKUP is not a free DELIVERY, and nothing here lets one become the other.
pub const COLLECTION_FROM_CLIENT_IS_FREE : bool = true;
pub const FREE_COLLECTION_IS_TIED_TO_A_PAID_DELIVERY : bool = true;
pub const THERE_IS_NO_FREE_DELIVERY_RADIUS : bool = true;
pub const PICKUP_IS_FROM_THE_BASE : bool = true;
