; legitimate zero in this file. It is not evidence that delivery anywhere is free, and it is not the
; shape of an unpriced district: that is FEE_ABSENT below. Keeping the two apart is the whole
; distinction pricing-honesty is built on -- an absent amount is not zero. The brain widened this
; one from a per-area figure to a shop rule (COLLECTION_FROM_CLIENT_IS_FREE above); it did not turn
; it into a zero anybody may reuse for a delivery leg.
