; --- What the ladder still does not answer ---------------------------------------------------------
; A district OFF the ladder has no published fee, and the brain does not supply one. It is not
; silent about the gap either, which is why this refusal can be dated and bounded instead of guessed
; at: brain:business_rules:1426-1429, inside the Maikhao decision, states that the decision covers
; ONE zone and ONE number and that five further zones carried by the owner's sheet -- Phuket Town,
; Cape Panwa, Thalang East, Thalang North, Naithon -- together with a 1490 belt step are NOT
; confirmed by it. So five names and one figure are known to EXIST and are known to be UNCONFIRMED,
; which is a stronger statement than never having heard of them and a weaker one than a price. None
; of the six is declared here as a fee, and the ladder does not grow to meet them.
; CORRECTED 2026-09-24. The owner confirmed all five that day, at the sheet's own prices, as zones
; of the shipped table (THE SHIPPED ZONE TABLE, below), so they are fees now -- by the owner's word, not by
; the ladder, and not by interpolation. The brain still records them as unconfirmed: it was
; re-read on 2026-09-24 (brain:business_rules:1426-1429 today, :1417-1420 on the 2026-09-21 read)
; and nothing was written to it here. The 1490 belt step is NOT confirmed and is not modelled; see
; the section on unmodelled rules. The ladder itself is unchanged: area_fee_thb still answers
; FEE_ABSENT off the ladder, and six zones off the ladder are priced by the zone table instead.
; CORRECTED 2026-09-24, later the same day. "The brain still records them as unconfirmed" and
; "nothing was written to it" were true of the read they came from and are not true of the node
