; restored the other island's map. It restores the owner's Phuket table now. An override that omits
; the minute fields parses, as absent ETAs. MEASURED 2026-09-24, and narrower than all of this
; suggests: no handler reads the built-in table at all -- src/config.rs:166 builds it into
; Config.delivery_zones and nothing reads that field -- so the table customers pick from is the
