; Where the owner's table and the brain's ladder meet, they agree to the baht: all twelve ladder
; districts are in the table exactly once, at the ladder's fee, including the two rows the owner
; decided on 2026-09-06. The six zones off the ladder are the five sheet zones the brain calls
; unconfirmed and the airport.
test every_ladder_district_is_in_the_table_once_at_its_ladder_fee {
    assert zones_that_disagree_with_the_ladder() == 0;
